frozen.winter.start=§bElsa's fear has plunged the world into an Eternal Winter! Only an act of true love can thaw a frozen heart.
frozen.winter.end=§6An act of true love has thawed the Eternal Winter. Summer returns!
frozen.winter.none=There is no winter to thaw... yet.
frozen.winter.active=§b❄ Eternal Winter ❄

item.frozen.storybook=Frozen Storybook
frozen.world.ready=§b[Frozen]§r Welcome to the kingdom of Arendelle! Anna, Elsa, Kristoff, Sven and Olaf are in town. Elsa's Ice Castle stands 70 blocks north, guarded by Marshmallow.
