frozen.status.built=§b[Frozen]§r Welcome to Arendelle!
frozen.status.build_failed=§c[Frozen] Arendelle couldn't be built: %s§r Move to open ground, then open the Frozen Storybook and tap "Build Arendelle here".
action.interact.frozen_talk=Talk
frozen.kit.welcome=§bWelcome to Arendelle!§r Open the §lFrozen Storybook§r to follow the story. Elsa's Glove: use = ice blast, sneak + use in the air = ice bridge (look up/down for stairs), sneak + use on the ground = ice spikes.
