frozen.talk.anna.story=Hi! I'm Anna! It's coronation day, and the gates are finally open! Have you met my sister? Elsa is waiting at the end of the red carpet in the castle. Go say hello!
frozen.talk.anna.default=Do you want to build a snowman? ...It doesn't have to be a snowman.
frozen.talk.elsa.story=Please... stay back. I can't control it! Conceal, don't feel... No. Let it go. LET IT GO!
frozen.talk.elsa.default=The cold never bothered me anyway.
frozen.talk.kristoff.story=Kristoff, official ice master and deliverer. You're going after the Queen? Up the North Mountain? Here, take these carrots. Sven insists.
frozen.talk.kristoff.default=Reindeers are better than people. Right, Sven?
frozen.talk.olaf.story=Hi everyone! I'm Olaf, and I like warm hugs! You're going to find Elsa and bring back summer? I'll come too! Head north, the Ice Castle rises from the snow!
frozen.talk.olaf.default=Some people are worth melting for.

frozen.story.coronation.title=Chapter 1: Coronation Day
frozen.story.coronation.goal=Find Princess Anna in Arendelle, tap her and choose Talk.
frozen.story.coronation.hint=Anna is inside the castle with the green towers. The friendly characters can't be hurt, so tapping them is safe.
frozen.story.let_it_go.title=Chapter 2: Let It Go
frozen.story.let_it_go.goal=Talk to Queen Elsa in the castle.
frozen.story.let_it_go.hint=Elsa waits at the end of the red carpet. Tap her and choose Talk... her powers are hard to control.
frozen.story.ice_harvester.title=Chapter 3: Reindeers Are Better Than People
frozen.story.ice_harvester.goal=Find Kristoff the ice harvester and talk to him.
frozen.story.ice_harvester.hint=Kristoff is in the castle, and Sven is never far away. Kristoff also trades ice, emeralds and saddles.
frozen.story.warm_hugs.title=Chapter 4: In Summer
frozen.story.warm_hugs.goal=Find Olaf and talk to him.
frozen.story.warm_hugs.hint=Olaf hangs around the fountain. Talk shows when you're not holding a carrot; feed him a carrot to make him follow you.
frozen.story.north_mountain.title=Chapter 5: The North Mountain
frozen.story.north_mountain.goal=Travel 120 blocks from here to find Elsa's Ice Castle.
frozen.story.north_mountain.hint=Keep walking in one direction; the castle rises ahead of you. Riding Sven is faster!
frozen.story.marshmallow.title=Chapter 6: Marshmallow
frozen.story.marshmallow.goal=Defeat Marshmallow, the guardian of the Ice Castle.
frozen.story.marshmallow.hint=Keep your distance from his slam and use Elsa's Glove. He drops snowflake crystals.
frozen.story.frozen_heart.title=Chapter 7: A Frozen Heart
frozen.story.frozen_heart.goal=Craft an Act of True Love.
frozen.story.frozen_heart.hint=Recipe: poppy + diamond + snowflake crystal.
frozen.story.true_love.title=Chapter 8: An Act of True Love
frozen.story.true_love.goal=Give the Act of True Love to Anna or Elsa.
frozen.story.true_love.hint=Only an act of true love can thaw a frozen heart.
frozen.story.complete.title=The End
frozen.story.complete.goal=Summer has returned to Arendelle. Thank you for playing!
frozen.story.complete.hint=Keep exploring: Arendelle and Ice Castles now appear across the snowy lands.
